  "body": "## What changed\n\n- `fold_warnings_located` (`crates/ui/src/operations.rs`) groups `Warning::DrillUndersize` under key `223`. Before, it used `216`. That is the key of `Warning::AvoidHit` with `FixturePart::Shank` (the avoid range is `216..=220`).\n- A group prints only the line of its first warning. When the undersize hole came first, the pane folded the blocking \"Do not touch\" shank hit into the advisory line as \"repeated on 1 more move\". The pane did not show the shank hit.\n- `223` and not `222`: open PR #2836 moves `UndercutLift` to `222`. The two PRs do not collide when the two merge.\n- Decision record: `docs/decisions/3040-drill-undersize-fold-key.md`.\n\n## Pinning test\n\n`operations::warning_fold_tests::a_drill_undersize_never_hides_an_avoid_hit` folds one `DrillUndersize` and one `AvoidHit` for each of the five `FixturePart` values. It asserts six lines, each with its own move.\n\nWith the old key the test fails, and the output shows the defect:\n\n```\n\"warning: undersize hole at move 3: ... - repeated on 1 more move (to 10)\",\n\"warning: holder at move 11 violates protected 'Do not touch' item #1 (0.500 mm short of clearance)\",\n...\n```\n\nThe shank hit at move 10 has no line of its own.\n\n## Gates\n\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 3 steps, 0 failed (`ui build`, `ui suites: lib`, `ui suites: operations`).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- `cargo xtask gate heavy --base upstream/main --dry-run`: the diff reaches no heavy lane.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No GUI check of the Warnings pane. The fold is a pure function, and the test calls it directly. The pane text does not change for a program with only one of the two warnings.\n- `crates/ui/src/operations.rs` was 635 lines before this PR, above the 400-line rule. This PR adds 21 lines (the new test is in the `warning_fold_tests` module, as the issue asks). It does not split the file.\n\nChangelog: The Warnings pane shows a protected \"Do not touch\" shank hit on its own line when the same program also has an undersize-hole warning.\n\nBranch made from `upstream/main` at 08697d3c4.\n\nFixes #3040\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
